2. Send the access token to FastAPI using the Authorization: Bearer header.
3. Validate the token on the backend using the provider's supported verification mechanism.
4. Validate signature, expiry, issuer and other required claims.
5. Derive the application user and role from trusted server-side records.
6. Never trust a role, user ID or admin flag supplied by the frontend.
7. Never use a Supabase service-role key in browser code.

